AUDIO IS NOT INCLUDED

The upstream project vendors 149 sound effects and 5 background music tracks
(assets/audio/) sourced from Mixkit, plus a second copy of 11 of them under
template/public/audio/. None of that audio is redistributed here.

Two reasons:

  1. The Mixkit Free License permits using the files in a project. It does not
     permit redistributing them as a downloadable asset pack, which is exactly
     what bundling them into this kit would be.

  2. Upstream's own assets/audio/ATTRIBUTION.md records that six of the files
     cannot be traced back to a source entry, and flags them as requiring
     verification before commercial use. Passing along audio whose provenance
     the original author could not establish would pass along that risk.

Run `node shotcraft/fetch-audio.cjs` to download the audio from upstream onto
your own machine, under whatever licence Mixkit grants you directly. The script
prints the attribution table and the untraceable-file warning before it fetches
anything.

Everything else in the shot library — the 104 shot recipe cards, the reference
docs, the Remotion demos, and the template — works without audio. Audio only
affects the sound design pass.
